{"id":"a196c7fa2f0957d2","group":"89","path":"89/89-thm-solovay.md","title":"Solovay's Theorem","display":"thm-solovay — Solovay's Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-thm-solovay","aliases":["89-thm-solovay"],"display":"thm-solovay — Solovay's Theorem","depends_on":["[[89-df-gl-logic]]","[[89-df-arithmetical-realization]]","[[89-df-peano-arithmetic]]","[[89-df-consistent-pa]]","[[89-df-pa-provable-formula]]","[[89-thm-solovay-theorem]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-thm-solovay"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-thm-solovay</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-solovay — Solovay's Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0006800fa1c85177\" href=\"?note=0006800fa1c85177\" title=\"89-df-gl-logic\">89-df-gl-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1f581262c09d5e34\" href=\"?note=1f581262c09d5e34\" title=\"89-df-arithmetical-realization\">89-df-arithmetical-realization</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"86ad48bbd1843ed6\" href=\"?note=86ad48bbd1843ed6\" title=\"89-df-peano-arithmetic\">89-df-peano-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8c9363f0c1d91236\" href=\"?note=8c9363f0c1d91236\" title=\"89-df-consistent-pa\">89-df-consistent-pa</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8f382173effd5662\" href=\"?note=8f382173effd5662\" title=\"89-df-pa-provable-formula\">89-df-pa-provable-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"be68cce492414c6b\" href=\"?note=be68cce492414c6b\" title=\"89-thm-solovay-theorem\">89-thm-solovay-theorem</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Real}(\\mathrm{PA})\">\\(\\mathrm{Real}(\\mathrm{PA})\\)</span> is the set of PA realizations.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PForm}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\">\\(\\mathrm{PForm}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\)</span> is the PA-provable-sentence set, and\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cons}(\\mathrm{PA})\">\\(\\mathrm{Cons}(\\mathrm{PA})\\)</span> is PA consistency.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}solovay}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Cons}(\\mathrm{PA})\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;\n\\left(\nA\\in\\mathrm{GL}\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Real}(\\mathrm{PA})\\;\n\\tau(A)\\in\\mathrm{PForm}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\n\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}solovay}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Cons}(\\mathrm{PA})\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;\n\\left(\nA\\in\\mathrm{GL}\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Real}(\\mathrm{PA})\\;\n\\tau(A)\\in\\mathrm{PForm}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\n\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Solovay定理是可证性逻辑的核心结果</li>\n<li>右向是算术可靠性，左向是 Solovay 算术完全性</li>\n<li>一致性前提与 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"be68cce492414c6b\" href=\"?note=be68cce492414c6b\" title=\"89-thm-solovay-theorem\">89-thm-solovay-theorem</a> 一致；若 PA 不一致，右侧\n对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 都成立，等价式会退化。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-gl-logic","status":"resolved","id":"0006800fa1c85177","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-arithmetical-realization","status":"resolved","id":"1f581262c09d5e34","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-arithmetical-realization]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-peano-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"86ad48bbd1843ed6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-peano-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-consistent-pa","status":"resolved","id":"8c9363f0c1d91236","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-consistent-pa]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-pa-provable-formula","status":"resolved","id":"8f382173effd5662","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-pa-provable-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-thm-solovay-theorem","status":"resolved","id":"be68cce492414c6b","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-thm-solovay-theorem]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-thm-solovay-theorem","status":"resolved","id":"be68cce492414c6b","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"一致性前提与 [[89-thm-solovay-theorem]] 一致；若 PA 不一致，右侧\n对每个 $A$ 都成立，等价式会退化。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Real}(\\mathrm{PA})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PForm}_{\\mathrm{PA}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cons}(\\mathrm{PA})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}solovay}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Cons}(\\mathrm{PA})\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;\n\\left(\nA\\in\\mathrm{GL}\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Real}(\\mathrm{PA})\\;\n\\tau(A)\\in\\mathrm{PForm}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\n\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"A","display":false}],"bytes":1223,"backlinks":[{"id":"189150f03c9cdc63","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"一致性前提与 [[89-thm-solovay]] 保持一致，避免不一致 PA 下右侧\n对任意 $A$ 都真。"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-150","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-thm-arithmetical-completeness-full.md]]\n[[89-thm-arithmetical-completeness.md]]\n[[89-thm-canonical-model-gl.md]]\n[[89-thm-fixed-point-characterization.md]]\n[[89-thm-fixed-point-theorem.md]]\n[[89-thm-fmp-gl.md]]\n[[89-thm-gl-completeness-arithmetical.md]]\n[[89-thm-gl-completeness-kripke.md]]\n[[89-thm-gl-completeness.md]]\n[[89-thm-gl-decidability.md]]\n[[89-thm-gl-decidable.md]]\n[[89-thm-gl-soundness-arithmetical.md]]\n[[89-thm-gl-soundness.md]]\n[[89-thm-godel-translation.md]]\n[[89-thm-henkin-provable.md]]\n[[89-thm-lob-theorem.md]]\n[[89-thm-normalization.md]]\n[[89-thm-solovay-theorem.md]]\n[[89-thm-solovay.md]]\n[[89-thm-substitution-lemma-gl.md]]"}],"outgoing":["0006800fa1c85177","1f581262c09d5e34","86ad48bbd1843ed6","8c9363f0c1d91236","8f382173effd5662","be68cce492414c6b"]}